<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Your account has been activated</title>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1f2937;">
    <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;">
      <h2 style="color: #111827;">Your account has been activated</h2>
      <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
      <p>Your restaurant account for <strong>{{restaurantName}}</strong> has been activated.</p>
      <p>You can now sign in and start managing your restaurant.</p>
      <p>
        <a href="{{loginUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #f97316; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;">
          Sign in to your account
        </a>
      </p>
      <p>If you need help, please contact our support team.</p>
      <p>Thank you,<br />MenuGo Team</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
